{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lizard Brain is an atmospheric, arcade game that tests the limits of your memory and puzzle solving skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate a series of lethal mazes by committing the correct path to memory before the deadly traps become invisible, forcing you to rely on nothing but your wits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each successful run, you get to choose from a variety of challenges and modifiers, each designed to increase the difficulty and dramatically alter the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Choose between challenges that add extra traps, change the maze's orientation, or limit your time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Choices</strong> \u2013 Decide if you want to push your memory with mind bending puzzles or test your reflexes with fast paced runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Experience</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a chilled synthwave soundtrack that sets the perfect mood for a memory bending journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on your instincts, and see if you have what it takes to survive the maze and overcome the ultimate mental challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to be quick, because if you're too slow, it'll be a reptile dysfunction!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996950?t=1759662490","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/8c663755a8ccd5d2d0b9caa9aeb8bf54bfc38f84/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759662490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/1f150cd78088a82f39491cc385e5721ea2ab960a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t